"action_index":"1","choice_index":"","choice_id":"","source_cn":"哎呀，真是糟糕的温度。","textdes_id":"","document_page_count":"","document_title_cn":"","document_order":"","document_object_id":"","document_item_id":"","document_icon":"","document_image_icon":"","document_base_image":"","document_pic":"","document_gender":""},"say:2:1041548402:1":{"key":"say:2:1041548402:1","kind":"say","source_node_id":"2","source_node_type":"__DT.ActionNode","statementID":"1041548402","action_index":"1","choice_index":"","choice_id":"","source_cn":"可惜不能在这里降下一场大雪，不然，冻结的火焰一定会很美吧。","textdes_id":"","document_page_count":"","document_title_cn":"","document_order":"","document_object_id":"","document_item_id":"","document_icon":"","document_image_icon":"","document_base_image":"","document_pic":"","document_gender":""},"say:3:1041548403:1":{"key":"say:3:1041548403:1","kind":"say","source_node_id":"3","source_node_type":"__DT.ActionNode","statementID":"1041548403","action_index":"1","choice_index":"","choice_id":"","source_cn":"这话应该我来说。","textdes_id":"","document_page_count":"","document_title_cn":"","document_order":"","document_object_id":"","document_item_id":"","document_icon":"","document_image_icon":"","document_base_image":"","document_pic":"","document_gender":""},"say:4:1041548404:1":{"key":"say:4:1041548404:1","kind":"say","source_node_id":"4","source_node_type":"__DT.ActionNode","statementID":"1041548404","action_index":"1","choice_index":"","choice_id":"","source_cn":"如果不是看在<style=stress><player...","textdes_id":"","document_page_count":"","document_title_cn":"","document_order":"","document_object_id":"","document_item_id":"","document_icon":"","document_image_icon":"","document_base_image":"","document_pic":"","document_gender":""},"say:5:1041548405:1":{"key":"say:5:1041548405:1","kind":"say","source_node_id":"5","source_node_type":"__DT.ActionNode","statementID":"1041548405","action_index":"1","choice_index":"","choice_id":"","source_cn":"要来对战游戏吗？好啊，这里只有围在圆桌旁的长谈，可无聊呢。","textdes_id":"","document_page_count":"","document_title_cn":"","document_order":"","document_object_id":"","document_item_id":"","document_icon":"","document_image_icon":"","document_base_image":"","document_pic":"","document_gender":""},"say:6:1041548406:1":{"key":"say:6:1041548406:1","kind":"say","source_node_id":"6","source_node_type":"__DT.ActionNode","statementID":"1041548406","action_index":"1","choice_index":"","choice_id":"","source_cn":"干脆来试试吧。我很好奇，你的火焰被冻结在冰里会是什么样...","textdes_id":"","document_page_count":"","document_title_cn":"","document_order":"","document_object_id":"","document_item_id":"","document_icon":"","document_image_icon":"","document_base_image":"","document_pic":"","document_gender":""},"say:7:1041548407:1":{"key":"say:7:1041548407:1","kind":"say","source_node_id":"7","source_node_type":"__DT.ActionNode","statementID":"1041548407","action_index":"1","choice_index":"","choice_id":"","source_cn":"会像围困在琥珀里的虫子一样吗？还是像想要挣脱出牢笼的飞鸟呢？","textdes_id":"","document_page_count":"","document_title_cn":"","document_order":"","document_object_id":"","document_item_id":"","document_icon":"","document_image_icon":"","document_base_image":"","document_pic":"","document_gender":""},"say:8:1041548408:1":{"key":"say:8:1041548408:1","kind":"say","source_node_id":"8","source_node_type":"__DT.ActionNode","statementID":"1041548408","action_index":"1","choice_index":"","choice_id":"","source_cn":"是吗？我的火焰将烧尽你无知的自负。","textdes_id":"","document_page_count":"","document_title_cn":"","document_order":"","document_object_id":"","document_item_id":"","document_icon":"","document_image_icon":"","document_base_image":"","document_pic":"","document_gender":""},"say:9:1041548409:1":{"key":"say:9:1041548409:1","kind":"say","source_node_id":"9","source_node_type":"__DT.ActionNode","statementID":"1041548409","action_index":"1","choice_index":"","choice_id":"","source_cn":"不要用玩乐的语调吐出残忍的词语，恶魔，你把生命看作什么...","textdes_id":"","document_page_count":"","document_title_cn":"","document_order":"","document_object_id":"","document_item_id":"","document_icon":"","document_image_icon":"","document_base_image":"","document_pic":"","document_gender":""},"say:10:1041548410:1":{"key":"say:10:1041548410:1","kind":"say","source_node_id":"10","source_node_type":"__DT.ActionNode","statementID":"1041548410","action_index":"1","choice_index":"","choice_id":"","source_cn":"能成为游乐项目之一，不是很好吗？","textdes_id":"","document_page_count":"","document_title_cn":"","document_order":"","document_object_id":"","document_item_id":"","document_icon":"","document_image_icon":"","document_base_image":"","document_pic":"","document_gender":""},"say:11:1041548411:1":{"key":"say:11:1041548411:1","kind":"say","source_node_id":"11","source_node_type":"__DT.ActionNode","statementID":"1041548411","action_index":"1","choice_index":"","choice_id":"","source_cn":"你的目光里满是仇恨，没人说过用那种目光打量别人很没礼貌吗？","textdes_id":"","document_page_count":"","document_title_cn":"","document_order":"","document_object_id":"","document_item_id":"","document_icon":"","document_image_icon":"","document_base_image":"","document_pic":"","document_gender":""},"say:12:1041548412:1":{"key":"say:12:1041548412:1","kind":"say","source_node_id":"12","source_node_type":"__DT.ActionNode","statementID":"1041548412","action_index":"1","choice_index":"","choice_id":"","source_cn":"对待你这种恶魔，做出任何礼数都是对神明的亵渎！","textdes_id":"","document_page_count":"","document_title_cn":"","document_order":"","document_object_id":"","document_item_id":"","document_icon":"","document_image_icon":"","document_base_image":"","document_pic":"","document_gender":""},"say:13:1041548413:1":{"key":"say:13:1041548413:1","kind":"say","source_node_id":"13","source_node_type":"__DT.ActionNode","statementID":"1041548413","action_index":"1","choice_index":"","choice_id":"","source_cn":"呀，那就太有趣了。要是有亵渎神明的机会，一定要叫上我哦...","textdes_id":"","document_page_count":"","document_title_cn":"","document_order":"","document_object_id":"","document_item_id":"","document_icon":"","document_image_icon":""